   https://github.com/vuepont/ai-elements-vue
   License: Apache License 2.0 (full text: licenses/Apache-2.0.txt)
   Derived: the Vue sources of `ai-*` items that were taken from this port as a starting point.

3. Svelte AI Elements
   Copyright (c) 2026 Sikandar Bhide
   https://github.com/SikandarJODD/ai-elements
   License: MIT (full text: licenses/svelte-ai-elements-MIT.txt)
