Modifications (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): files derived from the works above were changed by the Edmi UI
authors; the changes are visible in this repository's history. Edmi additions (artifact card/stack/viewer,
session panel, agent avatar, prompt input agent, chat composer, chat header, Suggestion card and chip
variants, Conversation home state, response typography) are original work and are not derived.

Per-file header convention (first lines of every derived file):
  React/Vue/Svelte script:  // Derived from Vercel AI Elements (Apache-2.0), modified for Edmi UI.
  Vue template files:       <!-- Derived from AI Elements Vue (Apache-2.0), modified for Edmi UI. -->
  Svelte markup files:      <!-- Derived from Svelte AI Elements (MIT), modified for Edmi UI. -->
See AGENTS.md "AI pack" for which header to use.
